### Test MoMo Payment Integration
### Make sure server is running on http://localhost:8080

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Create MoMo Payment URL with Fees (MOCK MODE ENABLED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/calculate-and-create-momo-url
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "user_id": 8,
    "package_id": 1,
    "vehicle_id": 7,
    "payment_type": "subscription_with_deposit"
}

### Expected Response (Mock Mode):
# {
#     "payment_id": 34,
#     "paymentUrl": "https://test-payment.momo.vn/v2/gateway/pay?t=MOMO20251121...",
#     "vnp_txn_ref": "MOMO20251121...",
