### 2. Create Basic MoMo Payment URL (MOCK MODE ENABLED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/create-momo-url
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "user_id": 8,
    "package_id": 1,
    "vehicle_id": 7
}

### 3. Mock MoMo Payment Success (if needed)
# Use this if you need to manually complete a payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/mock-momo-payment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "orderId": "MOMO20251121032131",
    "success": true
}

### 4. Query MoMo Transaction Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/momo-query/MOMO20251121032131
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get Payment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/33
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get User's Payment History
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/user/8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
